Declare nvctrl_extension_name const

Carried from the import of libXNVCtrl into ANGLE (cc068e9385,
crbug.com/590870). The commit does not say why; upstream keeps the
const commented out. Pristine upstream also builds in Chromium today,
so this patch may be dropped in a later roll.

diff --git a/src/NVCtrl.c b/src/NVCtrl.c
index 6eacc95426..e984373947 100644
--- a/src/NVCtrl.c
+++ b/src/NVCtrl.c
@@ -49,7 +49,7 @@
 
 static XExtensionInfo _nvctrl_ext_info_data;
 static XExtensionInfo *nvctrl_ext_info = &_nvctrl_ext_info_data;
-static /* const */ char *nvctrl_extension_name = NV_CONTROL_NAME;
+static const char *nvctrl_extension_name = NV_CONTROL_NAME;
 
 #define XNVCTRLCheckExtension(dpy,i,val) \
   XextCheckExtension (dpy, i, nvctrl_extension_name, val)
